<dt><b>CMD_COPYPAGE (11)</b></dt>
<dd>
<p> Copy screenpage
<br>&nbsp;
</p><pre><a href="/historical/en/vsetscreen/">VsetScreen</a>(-1,0,0x564E,CMD_COPYPAGE);
